Modifications: seed Kubernetes audit events were re-identified (account IDs,
IAM principals, IPs, names, timestamps replaced with documentation values),
stitched into a single attack chain, mixed with synthetic benign traffic, and
wrapped in each cloud's native delivery envelope (EKS CloudWatch Logs,
GKE Cloud Logging LogEntry, AKS Azure diagnostic records). Generated by
datagen/build_k8s.py.
